      "q": "How much does Hii Mission Technologies make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Hii Mission Technologies obligated $970M in FY2026 to date across 78 awards with an average award size of $12.4M. The company obligations are down 16.4% year over year. Historical obligations include $1.2B in FY25 and $1.1B in FY24."
