    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Hii Mission Technologies?",
      "a": "The General Services Administration and the Department of Defense are the largest buyers. The General Services Administration obligated $773M and the Department of Defense obligated $196M in FY2026 to date. Other agencies with recorded obligations include the Department of the Interior at $443K and the Department of Education at $388K."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Hii Mission Technologies sell to the government?",
